sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Tauri UI
    participant Policy as Policy Gateway
    participant Adapter as Safe Adapter
    participant Audit as Audit Log
    participant Evidence as Evidence Store
    participant AI as AI Verifier/Reporter

    User->>UI: Define target and authorization
    UI->>Policy: validate_target(target, profile)
    Policy->>Audit: record policy decision
    Policy->>Adapter: run structured intent
    Adapter->>Audit: record adapter start/stop
    Adapter->>Evidence: store normalized evidence
    Evidence->>AI: provide evidence context
    AI->>UI: finding explanation and report draft
